WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.340
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's start the screen saver.

00:00:05.093 --> 00:00:08.213
In window mode, shift S starts the screen saver.

00:00:08.703 --> 00:00:12.143
It's made from your own screen, and there are 36 effects.

00:00:19.387 --> 00:00:21.947
Press any key, and your screen comes back.

00:00:22.417 --> 00:00:25.457
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
